eb08a","layer":"original","quote":"乃檄告喻诸羌：为光等所诖误者原之〖7〗；能斩贼帅送首者，当加封赏","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":181,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":127,"end":159,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liusima-q-da54227a5e8b975a461f","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-32cda677a000bc8eb08a","layer":"original","quote":"既曰：“唯光等造反，郡人未必悉同；若便以军临之，吏民、羌胡必谓国家不别是非，更使皆相持著〖4〗：此为虎傅翼也〖5〗。光等欲以羌胡为援。今先使羌胡抄击，重其赏募，所虏获者皆以畀之〖6〗；外沮其势，内离其交：必不战而定","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":181,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":18,"end":125,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liusima-q-ef3433bbda9c25581700","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-32cda677a000bc8eb08a","layer":"original","quote":"其后西平麹光等杀其郡守，诸将欲击之","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":181,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":17,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
